# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — Conan CMakeToolchain 默认 CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR=bin 致安装目录冲突 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-16
# Software: rdma-core 61.0（srp_daemon）
# Gate: conan create package() / cmake install
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: draft-rdma-core-61.0-conan-libexecdir-bin-collision
title: Conan CMakeToolchain 默认 CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR=bin，CMake 向 ${LIBEXECDIR}/<名> 安装时与 bin/<同名可执行文件> 冲突报 "is not a directory"
trigger_tool: conan / cmake / cmake.install()
phase: packaging|installation
error_signature: file INSTALL destination:.*is not a directory|cmake_install\.cmake:.*Error|Error in package\(\) method.*cmake\.install
severity: 3
category: conan|cmake|toolchain|packaging|ohos
match_keywords: CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR, LIBEXECDIR, is not a directory,
  cmake_install.cmake, conan_toolchain.cmake, package(), cmake.install, srp_daemon,
  install destination, bin
keywords: CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR, conan toolchain, 安装目录冲突, is not a directory,
  srp_daemon, libexec, bin, 同名文件目录
approach: conanfile.py generate() 中显式 `tc.variables["CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR"] = "libexec"`，
  覆盖工具链默认值 bin，恢复 GNU 惯例 libexec 目录，消除与 bin/ 同名可执行文件的冲突。
root_cause: 本仓库 OHOS conan 工具链（conan_toolchain.cmake）将 CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR
  默认设为 "bin"（与 CMAKE_INSTALL_BINDIR 相同）。rdma-core 的 srp_daemon/CMakeLists.txt
  向 `${CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR}/srp_daemon` 安装 start_on_all_ports 脚本，展开后即
  `bin/srp_daemon/`——而 bin/srp_daemon 已存在为可执行文件 → file(INSTALL) 报
  "destination .../bin/srp_daemon is not a directory"，cmake.install() 抛
  ConanException，package() 阶段失败。
rec_approach: override-cmake-install-libexecdir
doc: 无（待 promote 后生成）

verification: rdma-core/61.0 实证：①修复前 conan create 在 package() 阶段
  `Error in package() method, line 102 ... ConanException: Error 1 while executing`，
  日志定位 cmake_install.cmake:82 "file INSTALL destination: .../bin/srp_daemon
  is not a directory"；②generate() 覆盖 CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR=libexec 后
  conan-verify G2 通过（含 test_package 三测试实跑）；③staging 安装树 libexec/ 目录正确。
related: E092（CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME 未知，同为 conan CMakeToolchain 变量陷阱）；
  E174/E289（install "No such file" 家族，非本目录冲突模式）。
